  is that they're donating and have them  consider how they're gonna think about  it 10 years or 20 years down the line so  I think sperm banks could do better by  their donors and they're currently doing  right now thank you so much for joining  us once again the book is sex sells see  e LLS whether you're an academic or not  this is a great read and thank you for  sharing your time with us thank you so  much for having me

